Package: safePivot
Title: Safe Drag-and-Drop Pivot Tables for Shiny and HTML Widgets
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Dongwen", "Luo", , "dongwen.luo@agresearch.co.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a safe drag-and-drop pivot table htmlwidget for R and Shiny. It wraps PivotTable.js with robust numeric aggregators, missing-value and zero-value summaries, factor-order preservation, heatmaps, lightweight Plotly chart renderers, Shiny configuration capture, and export helpers for CSV, Excel, RDS, and RData outputs.
